	"skills": [],
	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AN6BXqd0NU-S4NqoX",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 20, DX 8, IQ 0, HT 12, HP 35, WILL 0, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 5, MOVE 1, DODGE 8, DR 20. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AClDYbZ_FIWjv4a0f",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 68 (offense 29, protection 39), threat tier major, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AL-5s1D2zWqkfd94p",
			"text": "Acid (Corrosion Aura) (1d-1 corrosion per second), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. Always on, no attack roll. Any organic material or metal touching the ooze takes 1d-1 corrosion per second; stone is unaffected. Engulfed creatures and objects take it as large-area injury. Selective."
		},
		{
			"id": "Ab5T0dXsopGjaxTwF",
			"text": "Engulf (Binding ST 12) (Constriction Attack, effective ST 12 (thrust 1d-1 crushing)), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. No attack roll is necessary; the quarry may defend only by dodging and retreating. Moving through an SM-1 or smaller creature is an automatic slam. A victim who fails to dodge is pinned if smaller than the ooze, or partly stuck and grappled if equal or larger. Breaking free is a Quick Contest of ST. The ooze may constrict an engulfed victim at effective ST 12."
		},
		{
			"id": "ANw2_LILvA47OI3bp",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/gray-ooze.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "Ak53XWGYUGaZroHz-",
			"text": "Source template total: 90 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "A0-sZC7ykeRoa1Sim",
			"text": "Library-rebuilt template total: 90 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "AH5TFNCOE_qEcxDxx",
			"text": "CER was computed from parsed Typical Stats using the Dungeons On Automatic baseline CER path."
		},
		{
			"id": "Af9RcniSInIRssC0f",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
